			"Message": "refactor(CocoonManagement): Update health monitor method names for consistency\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "d577f0778d8d8315338ea92933a7aae13cabc298"
